ssutils
version: 0.5.0

A set of server side utilities that perform simple, stateless tasks.

Programs built: yph, capture, cgictest
(uses bundled third-party libraries cgic and md5 from external/)

Requirements
------------
- A C compiler
- CMake 3.16 or newer

To build and install
--------------------

cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/fs/tools
cmake --build build
cmake --install build

Executables are installed to <prefix>/cgi-bin and assets (images, cgic.html)
to <prefix>/share/ssutils.

Configuration options (pass with -D<name>=<value> to the first cmake command)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
SSU_ASSETS_DIR   Where assets are installed (default: <prefix>/share/ssutils)
SSU_TMP_DIR      Temporary directory       (default: <prefix>/temp)
SSU_CACHE_DIR    Cache directory           (default: <prefix>/cache)
SSU_CGI_DIR      CGI install directory     (default: <prefix>/cgi-bin)
